# The packages the server image runs, each pinned to the version the
# panel's and the apps' test suites pass on. Raise one here on purpose, with
# a test run, then run python server/lock.py, which writes requirements.txt
# with every package these bring in and the hashes of their files, so an
# image built today and one built next month hold the same thing.
